Subject: [PATCH 220/307] !F (Terrain Plate) Add CPU heightmap and displacement
 source loaders.

Introduce a row-major height field with bilinear sampling and loaders for
heightmap files and displacement textures. Read sources through ICryPak so the
runtime component does not depend on editor-only image code.
